---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" activeNav="about">
  <article class="ds-container-reading" style="padding-block: var(--space-12);">
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-h1); line-height: var(--line-height-heading); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">About Me</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-lead); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
      Staff Systems Engineer & Mobile Architect focused on on-device machine intelligence, kernel IPC, and resilient hardware peripherals.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Over the past decade, I have architected mission-critical mobile client infrastructure spanning point-of-sale hardware ecosystems, Android NDK performance optimization, and private local AI runtimes.
      </p>

      <h2>Core Competencies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>On-Device AI:</strong> Local LLM quantization (GGUF, AWQ), Vulkan compute shaders, Hexagon NPU delegates, speculative decoding.</li>
        <li><strong>Mobile Systems:</strong> Android OS internals, NDK/C++ IPC, low-memory killer (LMK) mitigation, high-concurrency event loops.</li>
        <li><strong>Hardware Ecosystems:</strong> USB host/accessory protocols, Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE), thermal management.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="callout callout-info">
        <div>
          <div class="callout-title">Engineering Philosophy</div>
          <div class="callout-content">Software running on personal devices must respect user sovereignty: privacy by architecture, zero background telemetry leak, and graceful offline degradation.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
